# The schema, in the order it is applied. One script per line; blanks and # comments ignored.
#
# An explicit index rather than a directory scan. A scan reads differently from inside a WAR than
# from a build directory, and the failure mode of the version that works in the IDE is a script
# silently not applied in the environment that matters. SchemaApplierTest asserts that every script
# present on disk appears here, so adding a file and forgetting this line fails the build.
V1__schema.sql
